From bb9af94ab164cfecee1486c2b212641132e165d2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: XNU 26 Rebase <rebase@local>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 18:12:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ios26: EL1 PAC fastpath, sandbox user-state TLV, AMFI
 95/96/102, overlay, peripherals, thermal & OLED polish

- osfmk/arm64/locore.s & sleh.c: zero-cost EL1 exception-entry fastpath for
  EC=0 invalid PAC/AUT/XPAC/BLRA/BRA/RETA/ERETA traps on ARMv8.2 Cortex-A76/A55,
  full post-index and pre-index writeback emulation for LDRA*, and sampled sleh
  diagnostic logging so residual traps never saturate the ring buffer.
- bsd/kern/sweet_amfi.c: implement Sandbox MAC ops 15 & 16 in-kernel TLV user
  state store so containermanagerd / lsd / mobileactivationd pass sentinel
  container checks; add AMFI syscalls 95 (trustcache), 96 (bootarg state 0x86),
  and 102 (launch constraint match = AICMR_MATCH).
- bsd/kern/kern_exec.c: persona-less UID/GID adoption with chgproccnt accounting,
  spawn_validate_persona NULL guard, and dylib injection for mediaserverd,
  containermanagerd, containermanagerd_system, and SpringBoard.
- bsd/dev/sweet_files.c & bsd_init.c: early POSIX ustar root overlay unpacker
  with regular files, directories, symlinks, UID/GID/mode preservation.
- bsd/dev/sweet_cpufreq.c, sweet_gpu.c, sweet_spmi.c: cool 1.80 GHz Kryo 485
  default (flamecpufreq=2), Adreno 640 675 MHz GMU OPP vote, SPMI helpers.
- iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetFramebuffer.cpp, SweetBattery.cpp, SweetHID.cpp &
  bsd/dev/rmx1931_{touch,battery,torch,haptic,audio}.c: 60 Hz direct scanout,
  AppleARMBacklight + true 0-nit AMOLED alpha=255 blanking + quiet boot
  (sweetfb_noconsole=2) with panic unblanking, Tap-to-Wake, 4ms/8ms Synaptics
  S3706 touch with retry recovery, live TCP 2223 /dev/sweet-diag telemetry,
  and BQ27541/PM8150B/TFA9894 peripherals.

